---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "Terms of Service — Pit Row Miami";
const description = "Terms of service for Pit Row Miami F1 simulator rental services.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/" class="text-brand-500 underline hover:underline mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to Pit Row Miami</a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p><strong class="text-white">Last updated:</strong> August 8, 2026</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8">1. Booking &amp; Rental Services</h2>
        <p>Pit Row Miami provides premium F1 simulator rental services for corporate events, private parties, and other occasions throughout South Florida. All bookings are subject to availability and confirmation.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8">2. Deposits &amp; Payments</h2>
        <p>A deposit may be required to secure your event date. Full payment terms, if applicable, will be provided in your booking confirmation. Prices quoted are estimates until a final quote is issued and accepted.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8">3. Cancellations &amp; Rescheduling</h2>
        <p>Cancellation and rescheduling policies will be outlined in your booking confirmation. Please contact us as early as possible regarding changes to your event.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8">4. On-Site Requirements</h2>
        <p>We require adequate space, access to power, and a safe operating area for our equipment. The client is responsible for ensuring the venue permits our equipment and activities. We will provide setup, operation, and teardown as part of every booking.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8">5. Equipment &amp; Safety</h2>
        <p>All equipment is maintained to professional standards and operated by our trained staff. Participants use the simulators at their own risk, and reasonable safety guidelines must be followed as directed by our operators.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, and images, is the property of Pit Row Miami and may not be reproduced without prior written consent.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Pit Row Miami shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our services or website. Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount paid for the specific booking in question.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8">8. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of our services or website after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8">9. Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@pitrowmiami.com" class="text-brand-500 underline hover:underline">info@pitrowmiami.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
